ent\" class=\"menu-left-content\"><ul id=\"menu\"><li class=\"active ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">About the offer</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined ng-star-inserted\">chevron_right</span><!----></a></li><!----><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Terms &amp; Conditions</span><!----><!----></a></li><!----><!----></ul></div><div class=\"right-content\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offer-rte\">\n<div id=\"#abouttheoffer\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>About the offer</h2>\n<span class=\"expire-note\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event</span>Valid until\n26 Sep 2026</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p>Celebrate National Day with extra rewards from Jahez.</p>\n<p>Earn 100% Bonus AlFursan Miles every time you order your favorite meal during the promotional period, adding more value to every delivery.</p>\n<p>Enjoy fast delivery, a wide selection of restaurants, and double the Miles on every eligible order.</p>\n<p>Celebrate National Day deliciously, and earn twice the Miles with every order.</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3>Offer validity</h3>\n<p>The offer is valid from 22 to 26 September 2026.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"#termsandconditions\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<ul>\n<li>AlFursan Miles are granted only when the AlFursan Program is selected and a valid membership number is entered before completing the payment.</li>\n<li>Miles are credited after successful payment and order delivery. Please allow up to 14 business days for Miles to appear in your account.</li>\n<li>The membership number entered must be linked to an active AlFursan account.</li>\n<li>It is not possible to modify or add an AlFursan membership number after the order has been placed.</li>\n<li>Miles are calculated based on the net order value (excluding delivery fees, discounts, and VAT).</li>\n<li>Orders that include donations to charities are not eligible for earning Miles.</li>\n<li>Orders that include purchases from convenience/grocery stores are not eligible for earning Miles.</li>\n<li>The term “Miles” refers to “Reward Miles” as defined in the AlFursan Program Terms and Conditions.</li>\n<li>Terms and conditions specific to Jahez apply.</li>\n<li>Terms and conditions specific to the AlFursan Program apply.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div></span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}